&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum:&lt;/strong&gt;Event-4273-4-CB&lt;br /&gt;
On the 25th of December, ████, SCP-4273 proceeded to manually activate, emitting sounds resembling grinding metal. SCP-4273 proceeded to breach containment, killing 3 personnel and causing massive damage to the site at large&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-497904-17&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;17&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; before exiting the main building, eventually leaving the entirety of site-95. Recovery teams eventually located SCP-4273 in a remote town, causing massive property damage as well as causing, at current estimates, thirty civilian casualties. Recontainment of SCP-4273 took 5 hours after it had breached containment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;Show&amp;nbsp;incident&amp;nbsp;timeline&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Collapse&amp;nbsp;incident&amp;nbsp;timeline&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 enters [REDACTED]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 process to come to a stop. It remains this way for 2 minutes,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 proceeds to ram itself into a tall building, causing the structure to collapse on top of it. SCP-4273 does not seem to be affected in any way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;local law enforcement proceeded to approach SCP-4273 and open fire on SCP-4273 once it turned to face them, showing no driver. SCP-4273 retaliates by opening fire. All of the officers were killed in the ensuing firefight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 continues to destroy major parts of [REDACTED], killing 5 more civilians.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After demolishing several more buildings in the area, SCP-4273 proceeds to move to the center of [REDACTED], before SCP-4273 proceeds to violently skid to a halt, hitting several pedestrians. Said pedestrians were confirmed dead upon impact.SCP-4273 narrowly avoids hitting an inflatable santa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Containment teams proceeded to attempt to recontain SCP-4273. 15 agents were maimed during the initial recontainment. 2 Helicopters were dispatched to assist with recontainment. MTF-Pi-1 is dispatched to aid in containment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 proceeds to engage helicopters, eliminating both via the ZPU turret and M6 flamethrower. SCP-4273 appears to be extremely protective of the inflatable santa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 evades all containment attempts for the next 13 minutes until a random bullet hits the santa, causing it to slowly deflate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 ceases movement and all hostilities. At this point, MTF-Epsilon-212 arrives and attempts to use SCP-4273-1 to regain control of SCP-4273.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273’s hood ornament glows intensly, proceeds to accelerate and rams into the containment truck. SCP-4273 then attempts to escape. SCP-4273-1 is lost for five minutes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 rams into a blockade, causing Agent ██████ to break his spine, paralyzing him.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Two tanks are deployed to combat SCP-4273. During this time SCP-4273-1 is retrieved by containment personnel and Agent ██████ is tasked with entering SCP-4273 and inserting SCP-4273-1 into the key slot.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Upon arrival, SCP-4273 engages both tanks, destroying one of them before being bombarded by artillery. SCP-4273s main front guns and turret are destroyed while SCP-4273 suffers minor harm, having several dents and rust spots covering it, despite the bombardment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 proceeds to burn several buildings, before ramming itself into the other tank. Bloodstains are visible on the hood of SCP-4273.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 proceeds to violently destry several other buildings except those displaying holiday themes. At this time an airstrike was ordered by MTF-Epsilon-212.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agent ███████ has climbed onto and jumped off of a small building directly onto SCP-4273. SCP-4273 Attempts to remove Agent ███████ by raming itself into several buildings. All remaining tanks and personnel were told to hold fire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agent ███████ enters SCP-4273, while the SCP attempts to engage all other vehicles in sight. Due to quick thinking by MTF-Epsilon-212 by hastily decorating several vehicles and personnel, no weaponry was used.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agent ███████’s head hits the steering wheel after SCP-4273 rams into a non decorated tank, causing him to go unconscious.&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-497904-18&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;18&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; SCP-4273 proceeds to attempt to leave the area. Barricades were put in place to prevent any attempt at further escape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agent ███████ recovers after a minute and hastily attempts to insert SCP-4273-1 into SCP-4273. Agent ███████ successfully inserts SCP-4273-1 into SCP-4273, subduing the SCP. Agent ███████ is successful in leaving SCP-4273 so it may be recontained. Agent ████ unintentionally forgets to call off the airstrike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The airstrike hits SCP-4273. Despite being hit with over [REDACTED], SCP-4273 remained operational, despite being heavily rusted, dented, and burned. Several of the weapons have been destroyed, rendering SCP-4273 defenceless. MTF-Epsilon-212 proceeds to load SCP-4273 into a vehicle loader.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 has been successfully recontained. All and all witnesses were given class-B amnestics and MTF-Pi-1 succeeded in creating a cover story of a terrorist attack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Containment procedures have been revised to accommodate this behavior. While it is currently unknown why or even how SCP-4273 was able to operate without SCP-4273-1, We have speculated that SCP-4273 may possess some form of autonomy. However that would not explain its escape from the site, specifically built to contain large non sentient movable objects. I recommend we make preparations in the event this does happen again, possibly with modifications to its containment cell. We cannot afford another breach, as the amount of resources and repairs we had to make was well over our annual budget.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-Sparks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; After another attempted breach a year later, containment procedures have been revised to include this behavior. Further research into this behavior is pending.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum:&lt;/strong&gt;After-Incident-Report-4273-CB/R&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RECOVERED INTELLEGENCE-4273-CB/R&lt;br /&gt;
After this event, MTF-Epsilon-12 had uncovered a mass production facility in [REDACTED]. Although the facility was in a state of severe neglect, several documents were found detailing the usage and means of production SCP-4273 underwent. Additionally, an advertisement for SCP-4273 was found, dating as far back as 1950. &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;No explanation for the date, manufacturing, or even potential sales have been found to support the time of print however.&lt;/span&gt; G.O.I-XXX Documentation has begun under recent discoveries. View both [DATA EXPUNGED] for more details. A note found on the back was also found, confirming SCP-4273 may indeed be sentient to a degree.&lt;/p&gt;
