&lt;p&gt;Illegible. Text is covered by a sticker attached reading “Just in time for the holidays!”&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-497904-19&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;19&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
