&lt;p&gt;[A large image of SCP-4273 with all of its components armed is shown in the center of the poster. A small family of four are standing next to it, with the youngest hanging from the [REDACTED].&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:xx-small;&quot;&gt;All forms and contracts must be signed completely and willingly. Renex Industries is not responsible for any accidents that occur when the product is improperly used. Do not use during the 25th of december.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:xx-small;&quot;&gt;If the key is lost/destroyed, contact ███-███-████ for a new one, or for repair. It is advised to stay away from the D.A.T. until representatives arrive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;** &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:xx-small;&quot;&gt;Preferably the Vehicle and Transportation Division, although the Assault and Defense Division is also available, as is the Head Division. The Gear and Attire Division along with the Health and Medical Division are last resorts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:xx-small;&quot;&gt;Jim, we have a problem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:xx-small;&quot;&gt;You’re whole “Use anything similar to a horse” plan is about to get us all into some deep trouble.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:xx-small;&quot;&gt;I would not worry usually but unfortunately the boss is coming by to make sure we make the delivery on time. How do you plan on explaining to him why we started using reindeer instead of the mares?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:xx-small;&quot;&gt;I get trying to find a replacement for the mares is hard, but for god’s sake, we needed those reindeer for the jet sleds! Not this.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:xx-small;&quot;&gt;And before you start asking what the big deal is, it&#039;s that they won’t start up and act like they’re supposed to. Boss wants these things moving by christmas, but it seems they&#039;ll only move DURING christmas. We need them to be ALWAYS active, like an actual animal, not some once a year zombie.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:xx-small;&quot;&gt;I don’t know what he’ll think, but odds are once he finds out his rage will be much more desirable than the big boss, which is saying something.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:xx-small;&quot;&gt;Also, we lost the one with the glowing red hood ornament. He’s gonna be pissed once he finds out.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-ash-krueger&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2341051&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608972647&quot; alt=&quot;Dr Ash Krueger&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2341051)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-ash-krueger&quot;  &gt;Dr Ash Krueger&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-497904-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. Personnel with Level 1 clearance are prohibited from coming into contact with SCP-4273.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-497904-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. Decoy building 98-C may be used for family/friend gatherings, to maintain moral and security.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-497904-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. Testing has shown the horsepower of SCP-4273 may very well be . SCP-4273 is composed of an unknown metallic material capable of generating and resisting extreme temperatures, the highest recorded being 7,092ºC.[[footnote]]The default amount of heat generated has been comparable to the earth’s core.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-497904-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. It is for this reason that SCP-4273 has a tesla coil docking station in the containment chamber.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-497904-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. It is for this reason a package of C4 is located within SCP-4273’s containment chamber in the form of a present.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-497904-6&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;6&lt;/a&gt;. See &lt;strong&gt;After-Incident-Report-4273-RC&lt;/strong&gt; for more details.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-497904-7&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;7&lt;/a&gt;. This can also be caused by faulty maintenance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-497904-8&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;8&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;strong&gt;See Addendum: 4273-A-R/R&lt;/strong&gt;for more details.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-497904-9&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;9&lt;/a&gt;. Approximately two weeks after the event, Dr. ██████ attempted to activate SCP-4273 before [DATA EXPUNGED]. This was also the first time that SCP-4273 seemed to respond “flawlessly” to its driver&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-497904-10&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;10&lt;/a&gt;. ██████ was later confirmed to have been scheduled to perform with SCP-4273 before the attack&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-497904-11&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;11&lt;/a&gt;. accompanied by an image of what appears to show a snowflake pattern of construction tools and various weaponry, and an electrified hammer in the center.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-497904-12&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;12&lt;/a&gt;. see Document-4273-p-G.O.I-XX&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-497904-13&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;13&lt;/a&gt;. See &lt;strong&gt;Document 4273-T2-A&lt;/strong&gt; for full information on tests conducted with trailers.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-497904-14&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;14&lt;/a&gt;. around the size of the fourth largest recorded domestic horse&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-497904-15&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;15&lt;/a&gt;. It is for this reason SCP-4273 has not been disassembled to examine.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-497904-16&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;16&lt;/a&gt;. It is currently unknown if the individual is the owner or an employee of the company.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-497904-17&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;17&lt;/a&gt;. At least 3/4ths of site-95 were completely eradicated.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-497904-18&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;18&lt;/a&gt;. Examination afterward showed Agent had suffered a mild concussion.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-497904-19&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;19&lt;/a&gt;. the placing of the sticker suggests it was added hastily.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</description>
